OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FMist and fog likely for many
OL,6,Fareas, this will mostly lift and clear
OL,7,Fslowly but linger in places. Feeling
OL,8,Fmild in any brighter spells. Light
OL,9,Fwinds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fto start with patchy rain, but a fine
OL,13,Fend to Sunday. Fine and dry on Monday
OL,14,Fbefore a cloudier day on Tuesday.
OL,15,FTemperatures around average. Generally
OL,16,Flight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
